1
00:00:03,003 --> 00:00:07,466
RED LIGHT ELEGY

2
00:00:08,967 --> 00:00:11,220
All right, going in.

3
00:00:11,303 --> 00:00:13,013
EPISODE 4

4
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,097
[Satoshi] Okay.

5
00:00:17,434 --> 00:00:19,770
-[customer 1 chuckles]
-[indistinct whispering]

6
00:00:24,441 --> 00:00:27,653
[customer 2] Hey, you're cool today too.

7
00:00:29,363 --> 00:00:31,031
[customer 3] You're so cute!

8
00:00:37,913 --> 00:00:39,623
Wanna go somewhere else?

9
00:00:40,499 --> 00:00:41,500
Yeah, let's go.

10
00:00:43,418 --> 00:00:45,837
THE LOVE EXAM TABLE (5 ROOMS)
GUILLOTINE RESTRAINTS (ROOM 202/206/210)

11
00:00:45,921 --> 00:00:48,340
BACK-BOUND RESTRAINTS (ROOM 203/305)
V-SHAPE LEG SPREADER (ROOM 203/308)

12
00:00:48,423 --> 00:00:51,343
ALL ROOMS FULLY UPGRADED
WITH REAL BDSM GEAR!!

13
00:00:56,515 --> 00:01:00,352
No, no, no!
They're for advanced users, right?

14
00:01:00,936 --> 00:01:03,105
-What are "advanced users"?
-[chuckles] No.

15
00:01:03,188 --> 00:01:04,898
-What are we doing then?
-Eh?

16
00:01:04,982 --> 00:01:07,526
Let's try somewhere else.
Just go somewhere else.

17
00:01:09,444 --> 00:01:12,447
This place won't do.
The reviews are all bad.

18
00:01:13,031 --> 00:01:14,950
Aren't they all the same anyway?

19
00:01:15,284 --> 00:01:17,244
A good atmosphere is better, right?

20
00:01:17,828 --> 00:01:21,707
I'd prefer it to be
a light post-meal workout.

21
00:01:23,125 --> 00:01:25,335
I'm not used to this like you are, Chiko.

22
00:01:25,419 --> 00:01:29,631
Idiot! Don't make me sound like a whore.
I'm not that experienced either!

23
00:01:29,715 --> 00:01:31,550
I didn't mean it like that!

24
00:01:37,055 --> 00:01:41,101
So now what?
Looks like there's nothing down this road.

25
00:01:47,316 --> 00:01:48,608
[Chiko sighs]

26
00:01:56,533 --> 00:01:58,118
[car horn honking]

27
00:01:59,453 --> 00:02:02,706
[shouts] Shut up and drive past, asshole!
[tuts]

28
00:02:04,249 --> 00:02:07,252
So? Go right or left?

29
00:02:07,336 --> 00:02:08,754
I'm looking it up right now!

30
00:02:09,504 --> 00:02:11,715
Anywhere is fine,
just hurry up and decide.

31
00:02:14,968 --> 00:02:16,720
Chiko, you're smoking way too much!

32
00:02:17,929 --> 00:02:19,473
It's smoky. You'll get cancer.

33
00:02:27,606 --> 00:02:29,274
[blowing air]

34
00:02:31,943 --> 00:02:34,446
Forget it. We're going home.

35
00:02:35,405 --> 00:02:39,159
Huh? Wait. Why?

36
00:02:40,577 --> 00:02:43,372
[Satoshi] Where to, Chiko?
You don't even know the way, right?

37
00:02:43,455 --> 00:02:46,124
-[Chiko] It's a shortcut, a shortcut.
-[Satoshi] What?

38
00:02:48,794 --> 00:02:50,754
Are you sure this road is fine?

39
00:02:53,757 --> 00:02:56,385
-You're totally lost.
-[Chiko] Shut up, I don't care!

40
00:02:59,429 --> 00:03:00,597
[tires screeching]

41
00:03:00,681 --> 00:03:02,516
-[Satoshi exclaims, grunts]
-[thumps]

42
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:04,601
[truck beeping]

43
00:03:08,105 --> 00:03:10,857
-[Satoshi] Ready, set, go! [grunts]
-[engine revving]

44
00:03:15,153 --> 00:03:17,155
Ready, set, go! [grunts]

45
00:03:19,032 --> 00:03:21,493
[grunts, groans]

46
00:03:21,576 --> 00:03:23,036
Damn, this is the worst!

47
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,621
[panting]

48
00:03:24,705 --> 00:03:28,333
-Gosh. We're totally stuck.
-[truck door closes]

49
00:03:28,417 --> 00:03:30,168
[Chiko] What a streak of bad luck.

50
00:03:32,045 --> 00:03:34,256
That's because you took this road!

51
00:03:34,965 --> 00:03:37,092
And you brought up going to a hotel!

52
00:03:38,135 --> 00:03:40,387
We should've just stayed put and waited!

53
00:03:40,470 --> 00:03:43,765
-There! What the hell are you doing?
-Ouch!

54
00:03:45,684 --> 00:03:48,520
[both grunting]

55
00:03:52,691 --> 00:03:53,942
[muffled yell]

56
00:04:11,084 --> 00:04:12,335
Can we stop fighting?

57
00:04:14,337 --> 00:04:15,338
[Chiko] Yeah.

58
00:04:21,136 --> 00:04:22,596
It was my fault.

59
00:04:24,222 --> 00:04:27,726
I didn't want to mess up,
so I overthought everything.

60
00:04:29,186 --> 00:04:30,353
[Satoshi sneezes]

61
00:04:31,021 --> 00:04:34,524
[coughs, sniffling]

62
00:04:38,779 --> 00:04:41,907
You always overcomplicate things, really.

63
00:04:45,327 --> 00:04:47,370
There's no mood left here.

64
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:49,331
[chuckles]

65
00:04:52,751 --> 00:04:55,086
[♪ soft music playing]

66
00:05:25,742 --> 00:05:27,327
[Satoshi] It's not coming off.

67
00:05:37,546 --> 00:05:39,339
[Chiko] Don't stare like that.

68
00:05:39,923 --> 00:05:43,802
[Satoshi] Right. Sorry. My bad.

69
00:05:54,354 --> 00:05:56,523
[♪ soft music continues]

70
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:07,242
-[Chiko gasps]
-Huh?

71
00:06:07,325 --> 00:06:08,994
[Chiko] Where are you putting your face?

72
00:06:09,077 --> 00:06:10,996
-Eh?
-[Chiko] None of that tonight.

73
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:12,914
Wait, for real?

74
00:06:14,207 --> 00:06:16,501
I thought everyone did that.

75
00:06:16,585 --> 00:06:18,962
-[Chiko] Dumbass.
-Sorry.

76
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:28,179
[♪ soft music continues]

77
00:06:39,482 --> 00:06:41,818
[insects chirping]

78
00:06:45,655 --> 00:06:47,449
[Chiko] The rain stopped.

79
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:50,201
[Satoshi] Yeah.

80
00:06:55,582 --> 00:06:56,666
Chiko!

81
00:06:59,127 --> 00:07:01,838
[Chiko] Don't be such a chicken.
There's no one around.

82
00:07:14,726 --> 00:07:18,104
Truth is... I was pretty scared too.

83
00:07:20,982 --> 00:07:22,233
You were?

84
00:07:24,069 --> 00:07:28,448
With my ex,
we got along right after we met.

85
00:07:30,116 --> 00:07:31,451
I'd never felt that way.

86
00:07:34,496 --> 00:07:35,830
We moved in together,

87
00:07:37,207 --> 00:07:38,708
fought like crazy,

88
00:07:40,377 --> 00:07:44,005
went through a ton of painful stuff,
and finally split up.

89
00:07:46,257 --> 00:07:47,801
I thought I'd feel relieved.

90
00:07:51,179 --> 00:07:52,472
But you know...

91
00:07:56,559 --> 00:07:58,353
once he was gone,

92
00:08:01,981 --> 00:08:03,608
it was even harder

93
00:08:05,527 --> 00:08:06,945
and more painful.

94
00:08:09,155 --> 00:08:11,408
[♪ somber music playing]

95
00:08:11,491 --> 00:08:13,535
Once was enough for me.

96
00:08:18,915 --> 00:08:22,001
When I started dating you,
I thought I was ready.

97
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:25,880
But now...

98
00:08:28,341 --> 00:08:29,467
I'm not quite sure.

99
00:08:42,897 --> 00:08:43,898
Chiko.

100
00:08:51,031 --> 00:08:52,490
Let's live together.

101
00:09:20,435 --> 00:09:23,438
[Chiko's mom scoffs] A screwed-up family?

102
00:09:27,650 --> 00:09:29,402
[Chiko] Dad's debt collector again?

103
00:09:31,279 --> 00:09:33,531
They never get tired of this.

104
00:09:33,615 --> 00:09:37,911
[Chiko's mom] Maybe I should leave it up
and save myself the hassle.

105
00:09:37,994 --> 00:09:40,246
Think Dad will be stumbling
back home soon?

106
00:09:40,747 --> 00:09:42,582
I'll kick right to his ass.

107
00:09:44,167 --> 00:09:47,128
But you look so pleased with yourself.

108
00:09:47,754 --> 00:09:50,590
Home in the morning
with a hickey on your neck?

109
00:09:50,673 --> 00:09:52,008
What? [gasps]

110
00:09:52,092 --> 00:09:53,718
Just kidding, just kidding.

111
00:09:54,761 --> 00:09:55,762
You old hag!

112
00:09:57,472 --> 00:10:00,600
What, so you're really dating that guy?

113
00:10:02,268 --> 00:10:03,269
[Chiko] Yeah.

114
00:10:04,938 --> 00:10:06,564
I'm staying with him from today,

115
00:10:07,065 --> 00:10:08,483
so don't worry about dinner.

116
00:10:13,196 --> 00:10:14,823
Then take this with you,

117
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:19,077
your pay for this month.

118
00:10:21,079 --> 00:10:22,455
A bit greasy though.

119
00:10:24,249 --> 00:10:27,585
SHITTY FAMILY.
THAT LANDLORD TRASH WON'T REFUND ME.

120
00:10:28,503 --> 00:10:30,505
[Chiko] I'll still come help with work.

121
00:10:32,465 --> 00:10:34,300
Don't push yourself too hard.

122
00:10:36,678 --> 00:10:38,471
YANAGAWA

123
00:10:39,472 --> 00:10:40,598
AKIYAMA

124
00:10:47,605 --> 00:10:52,819
Mm! So good! Thanks for the food.
Good, right?

125
00:10:53,153 --> 00:10:54,654
-Yeah.
-I know.

126
00:10:55,697 --> 00:10:58,533
It's just regular wakame soup
with extra egg.

127
00:10:58,992 --> 00:11:00,243
My dad used to love it.

128
00:11:05,999 --> 00:11:08,418
[deep inhale] Chiko.

129
00:11:09,544 --> 00:11:11,462
Let's get along from now on.

130
00:11:12,881 --> 00:11:14,591
See, always dramatic.

131
00:11:15,466 --> 00:11:16,509
Thanks for the meal.

132
00:11:17,427 --> 00:11:18,928
No, leave it to me.

133
00:11:19,888 --> 00:11:21,806
-Appreciate it.
-Sure thing. [chuckles]

134
00:11:29,314 --> 00:11:31,274
[Satoshi] How late is the snack bar open?

135
00:11:31,357 --> 00:11:33,985
[Chiko] I don't know.
If I'm late, go to sleep first.

136
00:11:34,861 --> 00:11:36,946
-Oh, the keys.
-Hmm?

137
00:11:38,364 --> 00:11:40,241
Which one should I take?

138
00:11:40,575 --> 00:11:42,076
Well, either one is fine.

139
00:11:42,577 --> 00:11:43,578
Wait.

140
00:11:44,704 --> 00:11:45,830
[Satoshi] There it is.

141
00:11:47,165 --> 00:11:48,166
I bought this

142
00:11:48,708 --> 00:11:51,127
at a gift shop in Ise when we went there.

143
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:53,880
Here, it's yours.

144
00:11:55,673 --> 00:11:56,925
[Inaba]<i> All right, everyone!</i>

145
00:11:57,008 --> 00:12:00,845
Our young boy here
finally lost his virginity!

146
00:12:00,929 --> 00:12:02,889
[all cheering]

147
00:12:02,972 --> 00:12:06,601
[workers] Way to go, Satoshi!

148
00:12:06,684 --> 00:12:08,311
[worker 1] Awesome!

149
00:12:08,394 --> 00:12:09,646
[worker 2] That's the way!

150
00:12:09,729 --> 00:12:13,191
Thanks, everyone. [chuckles]

151
00:12:13,274 --> 00:12:18,238
Let's celebrate your milestone tonight.
Actually, I have a go-to snack bar.

152
00:12:18,321 --> 00:12:19,739
Let me take you there.

153
00:12:19,822 --> 00:12:22,033
-A snack bar?
-Right. Snack bars are great.

154
00:12:22,116 --> 00:12:25,328
They're full of women with lonely hearts.

155
00:12:25,411 --> 00:12:30,291
I've seduced plenty of them.
They used to call me "a paper of Ikoma".

156
00:12:30,959 --> 00:12:34,462
I stick to the holes in their hearts
and seal them up.

157
00:12:34,921 --> 00:12:37,048
After that, it's just a matter of time!

158
00:12:37,131 --> 00:12:38,591
[laughs]

159
00:12:39,759 --> 00:12:41,094
Something wrong?

160
00:12:41,177 --> 00:12:43,137
No, it's nothing. [chuckles]

161
00:12:43,221 --> 00:12:46,015
Just... I remembered
that I have plans tonight.

162
00:12:46,099 --> 00:12:47,684
I got it!

163
00:12:47,767 --> 00:12:49,811
-Back to Chiko-chan already?
-Well...

164
00:12:49,894 --> 00:12:53,856
-My bad, maybe next time then.
-Okay. I'm sorry.

165
00:13:00,321 --> 00:13:04,033
Oh my, Chiko-chan! Aren't you stunning!

166
00:13:04,117 --> 00:13:06,703
So cute! Yes, you look nice!

167
00:13:06,786 --> 00:13:10,832
The first time my Hiroyuki's done
a nice thing for his mom. [sniffles]

168
00:13:10,915 --> 00:13:15,503
All the girls here suddenly quit,
so I was in a real bind.

169
00:13:16,629 --> 00:13:19,424
So, what am I supposed to do?

170
00:13:19,507 --> 00:13:25,263
It's easy! Just sit by the customer
and smile sweetly, whatever they say.

171
00:13:25,763 --> 00:13:27,807
Charm is everything for girls!

172
00:13:29,642 --> 00:13:30,768
[owner chuckles]

173
00:13:30,852 --> 00:13:33,021
Handsome, many pretty girls in here!

174
00:13:33,104 --> 00:13:34,147
Well, that's all right.

175
00:13:34,230 --> 00:13:36,774
-I'm not here for girls.
-Why not?

176
00:13:36,858 --> 00:13:40,737
-You came to the right place, buddy!
-Huh?

177
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:43,656
We've got a table. Just come and drink!

178
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:47,368
I have to go to my girlfriend's bar.
I'm trying to find it.

179
00:13:47,452 --> 00:13:52,707
Yeah, right. I got it! I know!
Table for one, please!

180
00:13:52,790 --> 00:13:55,376
[owner] Mr. Mura! [chuckles]

181
00:13:55,460 --> 00:14:00,381
Oh? A newcomer? Aren't you a beauty!

182
00:14:00,465 --> 00:14:02,216
First pretty girl here, Mama.

183
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:06,471
-That's rude! Chiko-chan, sit next to him.
-[Mura laughs]

184
00:14:08,681 --> 00:14:09,974
[Mama chuckles]

185
00:14:10,058 --> 00:14:12,185
Can I get a drink too?

186
00:14:12,268 --> 00:14:13,895
[laughter]

187
00:14:13,978 --> 00:14:16,481
From the start? Interesting, Mama.

188
00:14:17,523 --> 00:14:21,527
What did I teach you, Chiko-chan?
Smile, smile!

189
00:14:23,071 --> 00:14:24,530
Welcome.

190
00:14:24,614 --> 00:14:26,908
[Mura chuckles] That's it!

191
00:14:28,618 --> 00:14:30,578
[staff 1] First time at a place like this?

192
00:14:31,037 --> 00:14:32,038
Yeah, pretty much.

193
00:14:32,121 --> 00:14:35,917
Are you blushing? That's cute!

194
00:14:36,209 --> 00:14:37,460
What are you drinking?

195
00:14:37,794 --> 00:14:40,505
Eh? I shouldn't! I have somewhere to go!

196
00:14:40,588 --> 00:14:42,340
You just got here.

197
00:14:42,423 --> 00:14:43,883
Don't you like us?

198
00:14:43,966 --> 00:14:46,552
No, it's not that at all.

199
00:14:46,636 --> 00:14:48,221
[staff 2] Right?

200
00:14:48,596 --> 00:14:52,016
A beauty on each arm,
no way you'd hate that.

201
00:14:52,892 --> 00:14:54,811
I'll make you a shochu with water.

202
00:14:55,436 --> 00:14:58,397
No, but I... just that... I'm sorry.

203
00:14:58,481 --> 00:15:00,691
Where are you rushing off to?

204
00:15:02,568 --> 00:15:04,946
My girlfriend started working
at a snack bar,

205
00:15:05,029 --> 00:15:09,075
and I'm unsure what kind of place it is.
She didn't know when to finish, either.

206
00:15:09,158 --> 00:15:11,452
[staff 1] So you got worried
and came to pick her up?

207
00:15:11,536 --> 00:15:14,247
[chuckles] What a great boyfriend!

208
00:15:14,330 --> 00:15:18,084
Totally different from mine.
He hits me the second he gets mad.

209
00:15:19,544 --> 00:15:22,797
Well, in my case,
I'm more on the getting-hit side.

210
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:27,301
[chuckles] You totally look
like a henpecked guy.

211
00:15:27,385 --> 00:15:30,555
I mean, Chiko is really reliable,

212
00:15:30,721 --> 00:15:35,017
way stronger than me,
and I know she can handle herself.

213
00:15:35,852 --> 00:15:39,063
You lack confidence,
so you're anxious, right?

214
00:15:41,816 --> 00:15:44,652
Chiko had another guy before,

215
00:15:45,987 --> 00:15:48,072
but I only have Chiko.

216
00:15:50,116 --> 00:15:54,704
For some reason, I feel
she'll just drift away if this keeps up.

217
00:15:56,122 --> 00:15:57,123
You are...

218
00:15:58,416 --> 00:15:59,876
way too sweet.

219
00:16:03,629 --> 00:16:06,174
[staff 2] Maki-chan, what are you doing?

220
00:16:06,883 --> 00:16:07,884
Huh?

221
00:16:09,260 --> 00:16:11,345
[Maki] The restroom?

222
00:16:12,096 --> 00:16:15,099
It's in the back. [chuckles]

223
00:16:15,683 --> 00:16:17,560
No jerking off in there!

224
00:16:17,643 --> 00:16:18,644
[laughter]

225
00:16:18,728 --> 00:16:21,355
-[staff 2] Looks like he actually might!
-Right?

226
00:16:23,274 --> 00:16:24,483
[sighs]

227
00:16:26,319 --> 00:16:27,403
[door opens]

228
00:16:32,617 --> 00:16:34,619
So, what did you want to talk about?

229
00:16:41,083 --> 00:16:42,668
[spluttering]

230
00:16:44,420 --> 00:16:46,464
I... I have a girlfriend!

231
00:16:46,964 --> 00:16:48,257
[laughing]

232
00:16:48,341 --> 00:16:51,552
-You remember it well, don't you?
-[Mama] Seriously, that was ages ago!

233
00:16:51,636 --> 00:16:54,889
-I have a great memory. [laughs]
-[Mama] Stop it! [laughs]

234
00:16:56,182 --> 00:16:58,309
Hey, rookie. Chiko, was it?

235
00:16:59,477 --> 00:17:02,313
Say something clever to entertain me.

236
00:17:03,731 --> 00:17:04,815
Well...

237
00:17:05,816 --> 00:17:09,612
No good! You've gotta fire back
right away to make it funny.

238
00:17:10,238 --> 00:17:12,156
Whatever, stand up for a second.

239
00:17:13,157 --> 00:17:14,450
Hey, get up!

240
00:17:19,288 --> 00:17:21,082
Hey, what the hell?

241
00:17:21,666 --> 00:17:24,919
What? You can't even handle
basic hostessing,

242
00:17:25,002 --> 00:17:27,046
so at least offer me this service!

243
00:17:27,129 --> 00:17:28,631
That's not included.

244
00:17:28,714 --> 00:17:31,968
[Mama] Come on, Mr. Mura.
Don't bully our newbie.

245
00:17:32,051 --> 00:17:36,889
Huh? Don't make me look bad.
This is all part of her training!

246
00:17:36,973 --> 00:17:41,185
Chiko-chan, he's just joking. Calm down.

247
00:17:42,061 --> 00:17:45,565
-Here, sit! Sit down.
-[Chiko sighs]

248
00:17:46,524 --> 00:17:48,359
Must be nice having a pretty face,

249
00:17:49,277 --> 00:17:52,947
making money just sitting around
and sipping free drinks. [chuckles]

250
00:17:54,323 --> 00:17:55,866
But mark my words,

251
00:17:56,576 --> 00:18:00,413
that's only for now,
before you get washed up like Mama.

252
00:18:00,496 --> 00:18:05,418
Look at that makeup,
so thick you look like a monster!

253
00:18:05,501 --> 00:18:07,837
Oh my, that's so mean.

254
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:10,548
Well, maybe I'm just as bad

255
00:18:10,631 --> 00:18:12,633
-for coming to a dump like this.
-Indeed.

256
00:18:12,717 --> 00:18:14,677
[laughter]

257
00:18:16,762 --> 00:18:19,307
Hey, rookie, how much are you?

258
00:18:19,932 --> 00:18:23,102
-How much to get you in my bed?
-[Mama] Mr. Mura!

259
00:18:23,185 --> 00:18:26,480
Mister, this isn't that kind of place.

260
00:18:26,564 --> 00:18:28,691
Don't play so hard to get!

261
00:18:30,151 --> 00:18:33,904
Once I get hard,
you'll be moaning in pleasure!

262
00:18:34,405 --> 00:18:35,906
[moaning]

263
00:18:35,990 --> 00:18:38,826
-"It's my first time." [laughs]
-[Mama] Mr. Mura, that's enough.

264
00:18:38,909 --> 00:18:40,620
-You've drunk too much.
-All right.

265
00:18:40,703 --> 00:18:44,123
-You're mine tonight!
-Way too much. Let's call it a night.

266
00:18:44,206 --> 00:18:47,793
[exclaims] Don't let an auntie
mix the drinks. It'll taste awful!

267
00:18:48,210 --> 00:18:49,837
-No!
-[grunts] Cold!

268
00:18:50,588 --> 00:18:53,049
-What's with that girly voice?
-[Mama chuckles]

269
00:18:53,132 --> 00:18:55,176
[Mura laughs, moans]

270
00:18:55,259 --> 00:18:58,262
-Are you a young maiden? [laughs]
-[awkward chuckle]

271
00:19:00,931 --> 00:19:02,099
-Auntie.
-[Mama] Huh?

272
00:19:02,892 --> 00:19:04,727
-Forgive me.
-[Mama] Huh?

273
00:19:04,810 --> 00:19:06,937
[Mura laughing]

274
00:19:07,772 --> 00:19:12,151
Hey, forgive you for what? [laughing]

275
00:19:12,652 --> 00:19:13,736
[gasps]

276
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:17,073
[breathing heavily]

277
00:19:17,156 --> 00:19:18,908
Hey, you old piece of shit,

278
00:19:18,991 --> 00:19:23,621
who the hell do you think you are?

279
00:19:25,289 --> 00:19:26,290
[Maki shushes]

280
00:19:28,084 --> 00:19:30,461
Listen, this place is just

281
00:19:31,337 --> 00:19:33,923
a rip-off joint run by mobsters.

282
00:19:35,299 --> 00:19:36,342
What?

283
00:19:37,051 --> 00:19:39,303
Some scary guys are in the back room.

284
00:19:40,304 --> 00:19:43,349
You look soft.
They'll simply bleed you for 200,000 yen.

285
00:19:44,642 --> 00:19:47,520
No way. [breathing anxiously]

286
00:19:47,603 --> 00:19:49,480
[loudly] What should I do?

287
00:19:49,563 --> 00:19:51,440
[whispers] Keep it down!

288
00:19:51,524 --> 00:19:52,525
[sighs]

289
00:19:53,275 --> 00:19:55,236
Here, come this way.

290
00:20:01,158 --> 00:20:04,912
-Use the back door. Run for your life.
-Wait.

291
00:20:05,621 --> 00:20:07,790
If I do this, are you gonna be okay?

292
00:20:08,290 --> 00:20:12,795
Who knows?
But you look like a lost puppy. [chuckles]

293
00:20:12,878 --> 00:20:14,672
I feel so sorry for you.

294
00:20:17,508 --> 00:20:19,218
Come escape with me!

295
00:20:20,261 --> 00:20:21,387
[soft chuckle]

296
00:20:22,096 --> 00:20:24,432
Nice line, thanks.

297
00:20:25,975 --> 00:20:28,894
But this job was set up by my boyfriend.

298
00:20:29,478 --> 00:20:32,523
He'll get in trouble if I run.

299
00:20:34,316 --> 00:20:36,569
[distant indistinct chatter]

300
00:20:36,652 --> 00:20:41,157
[gasps] Hurry! Go save your girl!

301
00:20:46,120 --> 00:20:48,622
[mobster 1]
That guy's not in the restroom!

302
00:20:49,957 --> 00:20:51,292
[mobster 2] What? Really?

303
00:21:09,268 --> 00:21:12,271
-[banging]
-[indistinct clamoring]

304
00:21:12,354 --> 00:21:13,355
Chiko?

305
00:21:14,398 --> 00:21:15,483
[door bell jingles]

306
00:21:15,566 --> 00:21:18,194
-I'm never coming back, shit!
-Eh?

307
00:21:18,277 --> 00:21:19,278
Chiko.

308
00:21:19,361 --> 00:21:23,783
[Chiko] Don't you walk away from me!
I'll kill you, you asshole!

309
00:21:23,866 --> 00:21:27,328
-[Mama] Chiko-chan, that's enough!
-Ouch!

310
00:21:27,411 --> 00:21:29,246
[panting]

311
00:21:30,790 --> 00:21:32,041
Satoshi?

312
00:21:36,462 --> 00:21:38,339
[Mama] No pay for tonight.

313
00:21:39,965 --> 00:21:41,509
[Chiko] I'm really sorry.

314
00:21:47,014 --> 00:21:50,476
I told you to just smile no matter what.

315
00:21:51,727 --> 00:21:54,021
If you take their words to heart,

316
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:55,940
you'll never be a hostess.

317
00:21:58,150 --> 00:21:59,360
[Chiko] Mm.

318
00:22:01,111 --> 00:22:02,279
[sighs]

319
00:22:02,363 --> 00:22:03,531
That's enough.

320
00:22:03,614 --> 00:22:05,449
Your boyfriend's here anyway,
so head on home.

321
00:22:05,533 --> 00:22:06,867
[Chiko] No, I'll finish.

322
00:22:06,951 --> 00:22:08,786
[Mama] It's fine!

323
00:22:08,869 --> 00:22:12,039
I'll lend you that dress tonight,
so you two go have some fun.

324
00:22:12,122 --> 00:22:13,290
Huh?

325
00:22:13,374 --> 00:22:15,459
[Mama] Ah! Hey, kid!

326
00:22:17,503 --> 00:22:19,380
Want me to lend her this one too?

327
00:22:21,882 --> 00:22:22,883
For real?

328
00:22:22,967 --> 00:22:25,553
[Mama chuckling] You look so excited!

329
00:22:25,636 --> 00:22:28,931
-Auntie, what are you even saying?
-[chuckling continues]

330
00:22:30,975 --> 00:22:32,977
You got mad on my behalf, right?

331
00:22:34,728 --> 00:22:35,771
[scoffs]

332
00:22:37,940 --> 00:22:42,778
That guy will be back in a few days.
No worries.

333
00:22:45,030 --> 00:22:47,783
MINERUBA SNACK BAR

334
00:22:54,123 --> 00:22:55,124
[Chiko sighs]

335
00:22:56,458 --> 00:22:58,335
There's a lot to the nightlife world.

336
00:22:58,711 --> 00:23:00,963
[Chiko] Act like you know everything.

337
00:23:12,892 --> 00:23:15,603
Chiko, that dress looks nice on you.

338
00:23:15,686 --> 00:23:16,812
Shut up.

339
00:23:21,901 --> 00:23:24,486
Wait, can I take a quick photo? [chuckles]

340
00:23:24,570 --> 00:23:25,863
-You're persistent!
-[giggles]

341
00:23:26,488 --> 00:23:31,577
[Satoshi chuckling]
Why not? It's rare! Hey, wait!

342
00:23:35,664 --> 00:23:40,586
OSAKA'S TOP FOOD PICKS,
RAMEN AND YAKIMESHI (JAPANESE FRIED RICE)

343
00:23:40,669 --> 00:23:42,630
[♪ light music playing]

344
00:23:42,713 --> 00:23:45,299
[sizzling]

345
00:23:45,382 --> 00:23:47,051
[seller] Here you go,
ramen and fried rice.

346
00:23:52,514 --> 00:23:55,935
Ma'am, this combo really hits the spot!

347
00:23:56,018 --> 00:23:57,227
[seller] Thanks.

348
00:23:57,937 --> 00:23:59,271
[Chiko] This is so good.

349
00:23:59,355 --> 00:24:02,858
MARUHACHI CHINESE RESTAURANT

350
00:24:02,942 --> 00:24:05,361
[♪ closing theme music playing]
